00:11:01.710 --> 00:11:02.570
I got this really cool place.

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:05.690
It's not done yet. It's a it's a it's a nightclub or something.

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:10.590
Yeah. So then after that, now we get to the final level, which is what you're talking about

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:15.530
earlier, where like all the keys are at the bottom of the stage and you have to, you know,

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:20.290
by climbing the vines, push them up and unlock Donkey Kong's cage.

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:21.330
So this way he can be free.

